      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As an avatar creator and tinkerer I just upload the Android version on PC.\n\nIf it's a gumroad avatar just test toggles and make changes to animator to make options make sense. Like if a hair toggle is cut down, remove that from the animator, so that regardless of setting you still have hair.",
